{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:12.65.120","page_type":"section"},"citation":"12.65.120","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.65.120","content_hash":"5f4e0025f426bee9b6e0b4a84ca6458da0d2da00f9e0c705fe3612f7d6b8561b","heading":"Abatement by City.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.65.120:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.65.120","text":"(a) If the owner fails to abate the hazard, in addition to the remedy of prosecution and enforcement as provided in TMC 1.10.070 , the City Forester or other duly designated officer of the City may abate the hazard.\n(b) Abatement under the direction of the City Forester shall not be a defense or excuse to the owner of property. (Ord. 19699 § 13, 2-7-12.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"b67ae7f4-4e82-591a-a4a6-f24ef188740d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.65.120","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.65.120","content_hash":"a6fb190ff6840420bb92fac3bb6ebcdc5cbaf15a939d3d658c0f295af20d529e","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.65.120:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.65.120:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.65.120","text":"(a) If the owner fails to abate the hazard, in addition to the remedy of prosecution and enforcement as provided in TMC 1.10.070 , the City Forester or other duly designated officer of the City may abate the hazard.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"ac094259-d318-5807-8fbc-9dd8ee92ead6"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.65.120","citation_url":"https://topeka.munici